package com.example.rtlsdr

/**
 * P25 Phase 1 error control, matching the dsd-fme reference (lwvmobile/dsd-fme, ISC/GPL):
 *  - Hamming(10,6,3) for the hex words of the link-control / encryption-sync fields. The two lookup tables below
 *    were GENERATED by running dsd-fme's own Hamming_10_6_3 class over all 1024 / 64 inputs, not typed in.
 *  - Reed-Solomon over GF(64) (primitive polynomial x^6+x+1, roots alpha^1..alpha^2t), shortened to (24,12,13) for the
 *    link control word in LDU1 and (24,16,9) for the encryption sync word in LDU2. Own Berlekamp-Massey / Chien /
 *    Forney decoder, cross-checked against dsd-fme's ReedSolomon.hpp on random error patterns.
 *  - The 64-bit NID (12-bit NAC + 4-bit DUID + BCH(63,16,23) parity): decoded by finding the nearest valid
 *    NAC/DUID codeword (maximum likelihood; BCH(63,16) corrects up to 11 bit errors).
 */
object P25Fec {
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hamming(10,6,3)
